WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.255
Niko.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.968
Hi. Long time no see.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:12.762
Huh?

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:14.973
Who the hell are you?

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:18.935
GENZAN TAIRA
NIKO'S ENEMY, KOEI STYLE

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.609
-Now you remember me.
-What are you doing here?

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.361
I let him get close.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.031
Oh, I love it.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:34.951
You've beefed up beautifully
since I last saw you.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.161
You--

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.956
I have one thing to tell you.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.875
You've been chasing...

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.211
my master for the past ten years
in order to get your revenge.

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:48.381
But I killed him.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:51.843
How does it feel?

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:55.638
The man who killed your master,
Niko Tokita,

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.308
is already dead.

00:00:58.641 --> 00:01:00.852
You must be so mad.

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:04.147
Take it all out on me,
the man who stole your revenge.

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:07.317
Come on. Don't be shy.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.904
Go ahead and kill me
just like my master killed Niko Tokita.

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:14.741
I'll see you again someday.

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:19.204
I hope the next time
we see each other...

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:23.917
we'll be enemies.

00:01:26.544 --> 00:01:27.670
Niko.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.674
Now, strike me with your anger.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:34.719
The man who ruined your revenge
is right in front of you.

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:36.846
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:39.557
What did you say?

00:01:39.682 --> 00:01:43.770
Revenge?
Did you think that's what I wanted?

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:48.024
Your master and Niko only died
because they were weak.

00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:50.568
But I am stronger than Niko was.

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:55.782
The reason I was going after
your master was to prove that.

00:01:56.533 --> 00:02:02.288
I can't stand those fools who act like
they're the strongest of all of us.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.792
I'm going to crush
every one of those bastards...

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.587
and show them that I'm the strongest!

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.799
Luckily, there's a stage set up

00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:16.219
for misguided dudes
who think they're the strongest.

00:02:16.886 --> 00:02:19.722
I'm going to smash you
at that tournament,

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:23.268
along with all of those other
self-proclaimed "strongest" fighters.

00:02:23.768 --> 00:02:27.147
Look forward to it, you freak.

00:02:33.278 --> 00:02:35.738
You're right. You're right!

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:38.449
We should choose the best possible stage
on which to kill each other.

00:02:38.575 --> 00:02:43.997
Seek for love, fight for love,
and kill each other for love.

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:50.003
And then, in despair of losing you,

00:02:50.128 --> 00:02:52.839
I will shoot my load.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:55.466
Man, you're too much to handle.

00:02:55.925 --> 00:02:59.095
Now that we have a plan,
I should get going.

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:02.348
I'll see you at the tournament.

00:03:03.266 --> 00:03:08.146
Tell me one thing before you go.
What's your name?

00:03:09.606 --> 00:03:10.773
Setsuna.

00:03:12.609 --> 00:03:14.944
SETSUNA KIRYU
FIGHTER, KOUOU EDUCATION GROUP

00:03:15.153 --> 00:03:16.487
I'm Setsuna Kiryu. Don't forget.

00:03:17.614 --> 00:03:19.991
It's the name of your enemy.

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:28.124
Setsuna Kiryu, huh?

00:03:33.796 --> 00:03:35.131
Got it.

00:03:40.845 --> 00:03:45.058
Setsuna Kiryu!
I'm going to crush you!

